{
  "_comment": "Multitask finetune: polymer cloud-point (polymer_pool head) + an ENERGY REPLAY branch, both sharing the pretrained DPA-3.3 descriptor so finetuning the descriptor on 591 polymers does not forget its physics. Fill the energy branch's data path + finetune_head. See README.",
